    "content": "1. **Session Expired / 401 Unauthorized:**\n   - **Cause:** Firebase ID token has expired (typically 1 hour lifetime) or user signed out in another tab.\n   - **Fix:** Sign out from the user menu in the top bar and sign in again to refresh your session credentials.\n\n2. **Role Permission Denied (403 Forbidden):**\n   - **Cause:** Attempting to access a route outside your verified role (e.g., student accessing `/admin` or draughtsman attempting final approval).\n   - **Fix:** Navigate to your authorized dashboard. Role changes cannot be performed client-side and require studio admin authorization.\n\n3. **Forgot Password:**\n   - On the login screen, click **'Forgot Password?'** to trigger a password reset email via Firebase Authentication."
